# One run over several files settles a contract that a file declares without
# a definition against the verification of its definition in another file:
# a proof that rests on it stands where that verification establishes it,
# and is unresolved (callee.contract) where it does not, as within one file.
#
# RUN: %cpp-verify --jobs=1 %S/Inputs/across/src/a.cpp %S/Inputs/across/src/mathx.cpp \
# RUN:   -- -I%S/Inputs/across/include -DBUG=100 2>&1 \
# RUN:   | FileCheck %s --check-prefix=RIGHT --implicit-check-not=warning:
# RUN: not %cpp-verify --jobs=1 %S/Inputs/across/src/a.cpp %S/Inputs/across/src/mathx.cpp \
# RUN:   -- -I%S/Inputs/across/include -DBUG=101 2>&1 \
# RUN:   | FileCheck %s --check-prefix=WRONG --implicit-check-not=warning:
# RUN: not %cpp-verify --jobs=1 %S/Inputs/across/src/mathx.cpp %S/Inputs/across/src/a.cpp \
# RUN:   -- -I%S/Inputs/across/include -DBUG=101 2>&1 \
# RUN:   | FileCheck %s --check-prefix=ORDER
# RUN: not %cpp-verify --jobs=1 --diagnostics-format=json %S/Inputs/across/src/a.cpp \
# RUN:   %S/Inputs/across/src/mathx.cpp -- -I%S/Inputs/across/include -DBUG=101 \
# RUN:   2>/dev/null | FileCheck %s --check-prefix=JSON
# RUN: not %cpp-verify --jobs=1 %S/Inputs/across/src/a.cpp -- -I%S/Inputs/across/include \
# RUN:   2>&1 | FileCheck %s --check-prefix=ALONE
# RUN: not %cpp-verify --jobs=1 %S/Inputs/across/src/other.cpp %S/Inputs/across/src/mathx.cpp \
# RUN:   -- -I%S/Inputs/across/include -DBUG=100 2>&1 \
# RUN:   | FileCheck %s --check-prefix=OTHER --implicit-check-not=warning:
# RUN: not %cpp-verify --jobs=1 %S/Inputs/across/src/ping.cpp %S/Inputs/across/src/pong.cpp \
# RUN:   -- 2>&1 | FileCheck %s --check-prefix=CYCLE

RIGHT: Verified: scaled [backend=z3]
RIGHT-NEXT: Verified: twice_scaled [backend=z3]
RIGHT-NEXT: Verified: clamp100 [backend=z3]
RIGHT-NEXT: Summary: 3 verified

WRONG: Unresolved: scaled [backend=z3] [reason=callee.contract] (relies on the contract of clamp100, which its verification in {{.*}}mathx.cpp does not establish)
WRONG-NEXT: Unresolved: twice_scaled [backend=z3] [reason=callee.contract] (relies on the contract of clamp100, which its verification in {{.*}}mathx.cpp does not establish)
WRONG: mathx.h:2:42: error: verification failed: clamp100 [postcondition]
WRONG: note: counterexample: {{.*}}result = 101{{( ->|,|$)}}
WRONG: Summary: 1 failed, 2 unresolved (callee.contract 2)

The files are printed in the order they are given, settled together.
ORDER: mathx.h:2:42: error: verification failed: clamp100
ORDER: Unresolved: scaled [backend=z3] [reason=callee.contract] (relies on the contract of clamp100, which its verification in {{.*}}mathx.cpp does not establish)
ORDER: Summary: 1 failed, 2 unresolved (callee.contract 2)

JSON: {"backend":"z3","function":"scaled",{{.*}}"message":"scaled [backend=z3] [reason=callee.contract] (relies on the contract of clamp100, which its verification in {{.*}}mathx.cpp does not establish)","reason":"callee.contract",{{.*}}"status":"unresolved"}
JSON: "function":"clamp100",{{.*}}"message":"verification failed: clamp100

A file alone is as before: the contract has no definition.
ALONE: mathx.h:1:5: warning: clamp100 has a contract but no definition, so its callers are not verified; mark the declaration {{\[\[cppverify::trusted\]\]}} to assume the contract
ALONE: Unresolved: scaled [backend=z3] [reason=callee.contract] (relies on the contract of clamp100 (no definition; mark it {{\[\[cppverify::trusted\]\]}} to assume it), which is not established)
ALONE-NEXT: Unresolved: twice_scaled [backend=z3] [reason=callee.contract] (relies on the contract of scaled, which is not established)

A declaration that states another contract is not the definition's.
OTHER: Unresolved: halved [backend=z3] [reason=callee.contract] (relies on the contract of clamp100, which is not established: its definition in {{.*}}mathx.cpp is verified against another contract)
OTHER-NEXT: Verified: clamp100 [backend=z3]

Contracts whose proofs rest on each other through files establish nothing.
CYCLE: Unresolved: ping [backend=z3] [reason=callee.contract] (relies on the contract of pong, whose proof in {{.*}}pong.cpp rests in turn on contracts not established)
CYCLE-NEXT: Unresolved: pong [backend=z3] [reason=callee.contract] (relies on the contract of ping, whose proof in {{.*}}ping.cpp rests in turn on contracts not established)
